OL,3,ADemocrats win Senate and control of US
OL,4,ACongress after historic victories in
OL,5,ARepublican strongholds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Democrats win the Senate and the
OL,8,FHouse, taking control of Congress for
OL,9,Fthe rest of Donald Trump's presidency
OL,11,FThe party picks up a string of surprise
OL,12,Fvictories in Republican strongholds,
OL,13,Fincluding Texas, Kansas and Ohio
OL,15,FIn his first comments of the night,
OL,16,FTrump writes on social media: "I wasn't
OL,17,Fon the ballot and if I was, we would
OL,18,Fhave won in a landslide!"
